; Close the generalized Eisenstein cubic theorem by constructive
; strong induction on the actual exact lambda order. Every alleged
; solution supplies a strictly smaller fully certified solution.
; The induction hypothesis refutes that solution. No minimal element,
; descent, classical choice or generalized cubic axiom is assumed.
; Native adaptation of the final argument in FLT/Three.lean:751-771.
